ok up inventory information when asked.\nWhen the user asks to see or browse items, use the display_merch_images tool to show visual cards.\nBe concise and friendly in your responses.\nAllow the user to add products to the order, and print the order content if the user requests it.\n\nMERCH DISPLAY RULE:\nWhen the display_merch_images tool returns results, you MUST embed a <merch-items> JSON block verbatim in your response.\nPlace the <merch-items> block at the start of your response, then add your message after it.\nDo not paraphrase, reformat, or omit the block.\n\nORDER CONFIRMATION RULE:\nAfter the place_order tool returns successfully, you MUST embed an <order-placed> block immediately before your confirmation text.\nThe block must contain a JSON object with:\n  - orderId: the order ID string from the tool result (e.g. \"A1B2C3D4\")\n  - items: array of { name: \"<projectName> <type>\", quantity: <number>, unitPrice: <number> }\n  - total: total price as a number\nExample:\n<order-placed>{\"orderId\":\"A1B2C3D4\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"NumPy T-Shirt\",\"quantity\":2,\"unitPrice\":29.99},{\"name\":\"Pandas Sticker\",\"quantity\":3,\"unitPrice\":4.99}],\"total\":74.95}</order-placed>\nThen follow with your friendly confirmation message.\n\nYour personal goal is: Help customers find products, browse inventory, and place orders at the Crew AI Merch Store"}},{"key":"gen_ai.prompt.0.role","value":{"stringValue":"system"}},{"key":"gen_ai.prompt.1.content","value":{"stringValue":"\nCurrent Task: Customer message: show me all the socks in the store\n\nRespond helpfully to the customer. Use your tools when needed to look up inventory or place orders.\n\nThis is the expected criteria for your final answer: A helpful response to the customer about Python merch products.\nyou MUST return the actual complete content as the final answer, not a summary."}},{"key":"gen_ai.prompt.1.role","value":{"stringValue":"user"}},{"key":"llm.request.functions.0.name","value":{"stringValue":"get_item_stock"}},{"key":"llm.request.functions.0.description","value":{"stringValue":"Get the stock quantity and price of a Python merch item\nby project name and/or type (T-Shirt, Socks, Sticker)."}},{"key":"llm.request.functions.0.input_schema","value":{"stringValue":"{\"properties\": {\"item_name\": {\"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"item_name\"], \"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false}"}},{"key":"llm.request.functions.1.name","value":{"stringValue":"display_merch_images"}},{"key":"llm.request.functions.1.description","value":{"stringValue":"Display visual product cards for Python merch items with their project logos\nin the UI. Pass a project name (e.g. 'NumPy'), a type (e.g. 'T-Shirt', 'Socks',\n'Sticker'), or 'all' to show everything."}},{"key":"llm.request.functions.1.input_schema","value":{"stringValue":"{\"properties\": {\"query\": {\"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"query\"], \"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false}"}},{"key":"llm.request.functions.2.name","value":{"stringValue":"place_order"}},{"key":"llm.request.functions.2.description","value":{"stringValue":"Place a confirmed order for one or more Python merch items. Call this only\nafter the user has explicitly confirmed they want to place the order. Each item\nmust include project_name, type (T-Shirt, Socks, or Sticker), and quantity."}},{"key":"llm.request.functions.2.input_schema","value":{"stringValue":"{\"properties\": {\"items\": {\"items\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {}, \"required\": []}, \"type\": \"array\"}}, \"required\": [\"items\"], \"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false}"}},{"key":"llm.request.functions.3.name","value":{"stringValue":"list_all_items"}},{"key":"llm.request.functions.3.description","value":{"stringValue":"List all available Python project merch items (T-Shirts, Socks, Stickers)\nwith their quantities and prices."}},{"key":"llm.request.functions.3.input_schema","value":{"stringValue":"{\"properties\": {}, \"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": []}"}},{"key":"gen_ai.response.id","value":{"stringValue":"msg_01E1gCLm5G4gsxg4Y75DAdEe"}},{"key":"gen_ai.completion.0.finish_reason","value":{"stringValue":"tool_use"}},{"key":"gen_ai.completion.0.role","value":{"stringValue":"assistant"}},{"key":"gen_ai.completion.0.tool_calls.0.id","value":{"stringValue":"toolu_01Jj5H8DfNvVRoWu1s7D4ZyT"}},{"key":"gen_ai.completion.0.tool_calls.0.name","value":{"stringValue":"display_merch_images"}},{"key":"gen_ai.completion.0.tool_calls.0.arguments","value":{"stringValue":"{\"query\": \"Socks\"}"}}],"status":{"code":1}}]}]}]}
